Trademark & Hardware Safety Disclaimer
======================================

1. Independent Research: This repository is an independent reverse-engineering and
   interoperability project targeting the Sony Alpha 7R III (`ILCE-7RM3`, FW `3.10`).
   It is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Sony Group Corporation.
   "Sony", "Alpha", and "ILCE-7RM3" are trademarks of Sony Group Corporation.
2. Zero Proprietary Binaries: This repository contains ZERO Sony shared libraries,
   firmware images, kernel modules, or personal/copyrighted audio clips. Cross-compiling
   camera DSOs requires users to supply their own unpacked FW 3.10 sysroot via
   `--fw-root` / `$A7R3_FW_ROOT`.
3. Hardware Risk: Loading custom shared libraries into `im.elf` or modifying camera
   partitions carries a risk of system hangs, abnormal power states, or permanent bricking.
   Always deploy behind a verified dual-slot rollback daemon (`a7r-boot-guard`) with
   persistent USB Mass Storage enabled. Use strictly at your own risk.

